  id: Alanthor_Farm
  displayName: Farm
  role: Supplies from the Workers inside it - up to five, nothing when empty
  description: Built on your own ground, never on a resource node, at most six per
    player. Right-click it with Workers selected to put them to work inside; each
    Worker pays supplies every minute, scaled by how much of the crop ring around
    the Farm is free of buildings, rough ground and other Farms' fields. Empty
    sends them back out, and a destroyed Farm sets them down beside it alive.
